            <ArticleTitle>Tumor lysis syndrome in a patient with ovarian yolk sac tumor.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>92-93</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.gore.2017.11.004</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>•Tumor lysis syndrome is an oncologic emergency with profound metabolic derangements.•Germ cell tumors with large disease burden increase the risk for tumor lysis syndrome.•Herein we present a case of tumor lysis syndrome prior to initiation of cytotoxic chemotherapy for ovarian yolk sac tumor.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
